    "created_at": "2026-06-26T08:30:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-26T08:30:37Z",
    "body": "It's a bit unclear what remains of this issue and whether it's still worth addressing. But I guess @karwa's proposal is that we move U+005E (^) and U+007C (|) from forbidden host code points to forbidden domain code points?\n\nThat seems reasonable to me in principle. What do other people think?",
